WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.810
Instructor: Attendance in five steps.

2
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.180
Create a class

3
00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.270
On the My Classes screen, tap “Create Class” and type the class name.

4
00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:13.760
Invite your students

5
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:18.010
Open the class, tap “Invite Students” and share the class code.

6
00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.480
Students join by entering it.

7
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:24.410
If you asked for approval, accept them in the Students tab.

8
00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:27.280
Start attendance

9
00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.350
Tap “Start Attendance” and choose how:

10
00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:34.020
QR code: students scan the code on your screen.

11
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:37.970
Digital button: students confirm on their own phone.

12
00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:41.230
Manual list: you mark them yourself.

13
00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:45.040
Pick a distance so nobody can check in from outside the classroom.

14
00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.300
End attendance

15
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.390
When you are done, tap “End Attendance”.

16
00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:56.210
Records stay in the History tab, where you can also download the Excel report.

17
00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:59.540
Send announcements and messages

18
00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:02.545
In the Communication tab, post an announcement

19
00:01:02.545 --> 00:01:05.410
to the whole class or message a single student.

20
00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:07.440
They get a notification.

21
00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:12.880
You can watch this video again anytime under “How to Use”.

